				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "When a BEAM module recompiles, one announcement fans out to every GT surface that depends on it: Functions tab, Source tab, |> expander coders, browser sidebar. The payload carries the new function-entry list inline, so subscribers re-render without a follow-up bridge call.\n\nThe sections below open inline views (Fanout, Flow, Lifecycle) that already paint most of the architecture. Prose only points at what the picture shows."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
