				"string" : "## The dispatcher\n\n{{gtClass:name=BeamEventAnnouncer}}'s `Fanout` view paints the live subscription graph. Reading the colors: pink is the dispatcher class, blue the announcer instances (the `default` wildcard plus one per module), green the cache writers, gray the consumer groups (Arrays of receivers, labelled with class and count). Click any node to inspect the underlying object."
			},
