				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Two channels, visible in Fanout\n\nThe split is right there in the Fanout view above. Every recompile fires on `default` (top, wildcard listeners like {{gtClass:name=ElixirCoderBrowser}}) AND on the matching per-module announcer (one row per loaded module, narrow listeners only). The per-module rows that have a green cache writer are currently mirrored locally; the rows without one are tracked but unowned. See {{gtMethod:name=BeamEventAnnouncer class>>announceRecompiledFrom:}} for the dispatch."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-27T00:36:40.918469+08:00"
					}
