				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Payload-carrying broadcasts\n\n{{gtClass:name=BeamModuleRecompiled}} carries the new function-entry list inline (for the directly-saved module). Subscribers re-render from the payload alone, no follow-up `Analysis.all_functions/1` per surface. The example below subscribes a tap, saves HotReloadTest, and inspects the inline `functions` field."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-27T00:36:42.172282+08:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-27T00:36:42.172282+08:00"
					}
				},
