				"string" : "## {{gtClass:name=BeamModuleSourceCache}}, per-module source\n\nPer-module instance via `BeamModuleSourceCache for: aModuleName`. Sole subscriber to `BeamModuleRecompiled` for its module. On each event it updates its source map and entries list from the payload, then fans out two narrow events on the per-module announcer:\n\n- {{gtClass:name=BeamModuleSourceChanged}}: per (function, arity) whose source actually changed (filter is in {{gtMethod:name=BeamModuleSourceCache>>onBeamModuleRecompiled:}}).\n- {{gtClass:name=BeamModuleEntriesUpdated}}: coarse, fired once per recompile.\n\nThe `Flow` view below is the static architecture, useful as docs even with no live caches. `Lifecycle` underneath it shows the actual live cache instances and their consumers; click any green cache instance there to open its `Consumers` view (one module's announcer at a time)."
			},
